OL,3,GNEWSAScheme launched to help traders
OL,4,Areport shoplifting
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses are being encouraged to sign
OL,7,Fup to a free tool to tackle shoplifting
OL,8,Fas part of a year-long project.
OL,10,FHome Office figures show Barnstaple is
OL,11,Fthe second highest hotspot for
OL,12,Fshoplifting in Devon for 2025-2026 with
OL,13,F332 offences.
OL,15,FPeter Youings, who owns Youings
OL,16,FToymaster, Barnstaple, said shoplifting
OL,17,Fhad become "prolific". He added: "I
OL,18,Fthink when you are suspicious of
OL,19,Fsomebody and you see them in the shop
OL,20,Fand you think they've gone away with
OL,21,Fsomething, it's very upsetting."
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
