OL,3,GNEWSAScheme launched to help traders
OL,4,Areport shoplifting
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevon and Cornwall Police said
OL,7,Fbusinesses can sign up to a free
OL,8,F12-month subscription to UK Partners
OL,9,FAgainst Crime (UKPAC) which aims to
OL,10,Fprovide an easy way to report theft,
OL,11,Fanti-social behaviour and violence.
